## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 (dataset negative record; no GA model)
- **Short description:** A verified absence: Meituan never published a GA LongCat 2.5. The vendor's model-listing endpoint returns only LongCat-2.0 and LongCat-2.5-Preview (Orcarouter 2026-10-12 field check of Meituan docs, 2026-10-13); this folder records that negative finding. The real 2.5-line route is `model/longcat-2.5-preview/` (tracked separately, itself benchmark-free).
- **Provider / access:** The curated project id `opencode/longcat-2.5` does not resolve to a live vendor route. Only live 2.5 route: `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` (OpenCode Zen, incl. free slot `longcat-2.5-preview-free` per models.dev; Vercel AI Gateway; NanoGPT $0.75/$2.95).
- **Release / knowledge:** no GA release (the preview shipped 2026-09-25); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** none for a GA 2.5. Preview ids: `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`, `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview-free`, Vercel `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`.
- **Context window:** no GA figure; the preview route is 1,048,576 tokens (Meituan Retrieve Model example `context_length: 1048576`; models.dev 1,000,000).
- **Modalities:** no GA spec; preview supports text + image in, text out, reasoning, tool calling.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** no GA price; preview limited-time $0.30 in / $1.20 out / $0.006 cached per 1M plus the free Zen slot (models.dev, CloudPrice, Meituan pricing page per Orcarouter).
- **Architecture:** unpublished for any GA 2.5; the preview is closed-weight (BenchmarkList estimates ~1.6T/48B MoE but Meituan publishes no parameter count — Orcarouter confirms the vendor silence).

